By default, the <code>ftps_state</code> property is set to <code>"Disabled"</code> for <code>Functions</code> resources.

<b>Example 1:</b> The following example shows a configuration that defines an <code>azurerm_windows_function_app_slot</code> resource with <code>ftps_state</code> set to an insecure value such as <code>"AllAllowed"</code>.
