By default, the <code>sample_rate</code> property is set to <code>1.0</code> for <code>Cloud Load Balancing</code> resources.

<b>Example 1:</b> The following example shows a configuration that defines a <code>google_compute_backend_service</code> resource with <code>sample_rate</code> set to the insecure value <code>0.0</code>.
<pre>
